{"cc":"US","of":"US-DE","defs":{"tempF":{"label":"Mean temperature","unit":"degF","say":"the mean temperature of the year, the average of NOAA's twelve monthly means (worked out here)"},"tempMaxF":{"label":"Mean daily high","unit":"degF","say":"the mean of the days' highest temperatures in the year, the average of NOAA's twelve monthly means (worked out here)"},"tempMinF":{"label":"Mean daily low","unit":"degF","say":"the mean of the days' lowest temperatures in the year, the average of NOAA's twelve monthly means (worked out here)"},"precipIn":{"label":"Precipitation","unit":"in","say":"rain and snow in the year, in inches of water: the sum of NOAA's twelve monthly totals (worked out here)"},"heatingDD":{"label":"Heating degree-days","unit":"dd","say":"how far, and for how many days, the day's mean fell below 65 °F - the need for heating - summed over NOAA's twelve months (worked out here)"},"coolingDD":{"label":"Cooling degree-days","unit":"dd","say":"how far, and for how many days, the day's mean rose above 65 °F - the need for cooling - summed over NOAA's twelve months (worked out here)"},"pdsi":{"label":"Palmer Drought Severity Index","unit":"index","say":"NOAA's drought index, the average of its twelve months (worked out here): 0 normal; -2 moderate, -3 severe, -4 extreme drought; the same above 0 for wet spells"},"droughtMonths":{"label":"Months in drought","unit":"months","say":"months of the year with a Palmer index of -2.0 or lower - moderate drought or worse, NOAA's category - counted here"},"pm25":{"label":"Fine-particle pollution (PM2.5)","unit":"ugm3","say":"people's mean exposure over the year to fine particles, PM2.5, in micrograms per cubic metre of air"},"pm25AboveWho":{"label":"People above the WHO guideline","unit":"pct","say":"the share of people exposed to more fine-particle pollution than the World Health Organization's guideline"},"aqiGood":{"label":"Good days","unit":"days","say":"days of the year the Air Quality Index was good (0-50)"},"aqi